{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"3a342f5317af52acd716a9f81612643f637a50f8a68efd0e7c3f1f61645f1e41","slug":"index","location":"/intro.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"まえがき","numbering":{"title":{"enabled":true},"heading_1":{"enabled":false},"heading_2":{"enabled":false},"heading_3":{"enabled":false},"heading_4":{"enabled":false},"heading_5":{"enabled":false},"heading_6":{"enabled":false},"all":{"enabled":false}},"content_includes_title":false,"authors":[{"nameParsed":{"literal":"木山 真人","given":"木山","family":"真人"},"name":"木山 真人","id":"contributors-myst-generated-uid-0"}],"copyright":"2025","exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"intro.md","url":"/ds-seminar/_public/intro-d6b7995279bc331dda78465bda34c4dd.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"本書はデータサイエンスを基礎から学びたい人のために書かれた実践的な入門書です。\nデータサイエンスに関連する技術をバランスよく学べるように構成しています。\n読み進めるうちにデータ分析手法や解釈の仕方を段階的に習得し、最終的には自分でデータ分析のプログラムを書けるレベルを目指します。","position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":1},"end":{"line":6,"column":1}},"key":"dr2wd4NNgb"}],"key":"gjd3zjVsoM"},{"type":"container","kind":"quote","children":[{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"What I cannot create, I do not understand.","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"key":"IgzHMB6jNQ"}],"key":"S5uPknzkHu"}],"key":"znrmi91Fip"},{"type":"caption","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Richard Phillips Feynman","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"C7STvaIJOz"}],"key":"jl2IghpPJa"}],"key":"Y4Tbf76Nmg"}],"class":"epigraph","key":"yrk0PmC2ml"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"これは私の座右の銘です。\nファインマンの言葉は、理解の本質を端的に表現しています。\n単なる知識の蓄積ではなく、実践を通じた創造的な理解の重要性を説いています。","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"key":"M2nRKuBigN"}],"key":"JNfNhNcVPi"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"学びは、概念を頭で理解するだけでは不十分です。\n知識を実世界で応用し、自らの手で何かを生み出すプロセスを経てこそ、深い洞察と本質的な理解が得られます。","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":20,"column":1}},"key":"KS64Mfivgw"}],"key":"CXAO9YckAV"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"この原理は、科学や技術の分野に限らず、人生のあらゆる側面に適用できます。\n新しいスキルの習得、問題解決、人間関係の構築に至るまで、創造を通じた理解の深化は、\n個人の成長と革新的な思考の源泉となります。","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":23,"column":1}},"key":"rxSAo3stb1"}],"key":"pyAqMobPe2"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":30,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"本書は真の理解のために、","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"MWkZYp6816"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"実践","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"aJTJscFLM8"}],"key":"eRwuWDcZTO"},{"type":"text","value":"に重きを置いて書かれています。\n従来の学習方法では、まず必要となる個々の技術を習得して、その後実践を行っていました。\n例えば、最初にPythonの基礎を学び、次にデータ分析で使うライブラリを習得し、\nようやくデータを使って分析を行うという順序で進めていく方法が一般的でした。","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"h3lzZ0bpBE"}],"key":"LJLJEgogHq"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":32,"column":1},"end":{"line":33,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"しかし、この方法では実践までモチベーションを保つのは難しいでしょう。\n本書ではまずデータ分析の概念を説明し、それを実践するために必要最小限の技術を必要になったタイミングで学んでいきます。","position":{"start":{"line":32,"column":1},"end":{"line":32,"column":1}},"key":"kfmTAbMcC1"